## Verdicts

```mdl
verdict Note: Note has pitch, startTime, duration, velocity and articulation, but no data field.
  status: partial
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-sequencer/src/types/Note.ts#Note]
  note: The opaque per-note `data?: object` field is missing. `pitch` is `Schema.Number`, not an int with a 0..127 range check.
```

```mdl
verdict Track: Track names color as hue and defaults the pitch range to 21..108, not 36..84; it adds patches.
  status: diverged
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-sequencer/src/types/Track.ts#Track]
  note: |
    `color` (hex) is `hue` (a design-system palette name resolved by `hueToHex`). The comments and `SequenceGrid`
    fall back to A0 (21) and C8 (108), not C2 (36) and C6 (84). `patches` (sound mappings) is extra. `instrumentRef`
    and `muted` match.
```

